{"kind":"table","sheet":"Template","address":"A1:E27","rows":27,"cols":5,"values":[["It is recommended that you do not edit rubrics in spreadsheet format",null,null,null,null],["v1.0-s",null,null,null,null],["Problem and users",null,null,null,null],["Uses the assigned option card to state problem and users.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Both are exact and source-aligned.","Both are present; one detail is weak.","Only one is usable.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["System design",null,null,null,null],["Includes goal, platform/materials, and labeled design.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All required design fields are complete.","One field is incomplete.","Several fields are incomplete.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["C1–C3 criteria",null,null,null,null],["Writes three measurable success criteria from the assigned card.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 3 are measurable and aligned.","2 are measurable and aligned.","1 is usable.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["Evidence plan",null,null,null,null],["Names versions, log, three tests, comparison, and live demo.",null,null,null,null],[null,9,6,3,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"All 6 evidence items are named.","5 are named.","3–4 are named.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."],["Readiness and evidence responsibility",null,null,null,null],["4/40: own computer/login or equal school fallback, on-time start, correct filename, and checkable handoff. Documented school failures use the fallback without deduction.",null,null,null,null],[null,4,3,2,0],[null,"Exceeds","Meets","Developing","Not demonstrated"],[null,"Ready, correctly named evidence is handed in independently.","One issue is corrected after one reminder.","Repeated reminders or only partial fallback evidence.","No checkable evidence for this criterion."]]}
